Třídy
*****

.[perex]
Sekce `classes` rozhoduje o třídách a jejich členech: v jakém pořadí členové stojí, jestli každý uvádí viditelnost, kolik členů smí sdílet jednu deklaraci, kdy se píšou prázdné závorky za `new` a za atributem, a co se stane s modifikátorem, metodou nebo atributem, který nic nepřidává.

Část klíčů je čistě o vzhledu, třeba pořadí členů nebo závorky za `new Foo`. Jiné hlídají, že třída říká, co má: viditelnost u každého člena, `final` u třídy označené `@internal`, `static` u privátní metody bez `$this`, signaturu přepsané metody shodnou s předkem. Ty poslední tři mohou změnit chování kódu a jejich opravy jsou proto rizikové (risky fixes); co rozhodne, říká stránka [Konfigurace |/configuration#risky-fixes].

```neon
classes:
	members:
		order: [traitUse, constant, property]
		grouping: separated
	visibility:
		constant: required
		property: required
		method: required
	emptyParentheses:
		instantiation: required
```

```php .[before]
class Cart
{
	private array $items = [];  // The constant must come before the property.
	const LIMIT = 10, MIN = 1;  // Expected one constant per declaration, 2 found. // The constant `LIMIT` must declare its visibility. // The constant `MIN` must declare its visibility.

	public function add(Item $item): void
	{
		$this->items[] = new Entry;  // Expected `()` after `new Entry`.
	}
}
```

```php .[after]
class Cart
{
	public const LIMIT = 10;
	public const MIN = 1;
	private array $items = [];

	public function add(Item $item): void
	{
		$this->items[] = new Entry();
	}
}
```


classes.internalClass.final
===========================

The `final` of a class its author marked as internal, which nothing outside the package may extend.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `final_internal_class` .[decision-facts]


classes.internalClass.markers
=============================

The annotations, with their `@`, and the attributes, by their fully qualified classes, of which one marks a class internal.

- seznam jmen

Výchozí `[@internal]` · standardy: perCs `[@internal]`, psr12 `[@internal]`, nette `[@internal]`, symfony `[@internal]`, laravel `[@internal]` .[decision-facts]


classes.internalClass.except
============================

The annotations and the attributes that keep an internal class as it is, an entity for instance.

- seznam jmen

Výchozí `[@final, @Entity, '@ORM\Entity', '@ORM\Mapping\Entity', '@Mapping\Entity', @Document, '@ODM\Document', 'Doctrine\ORM\Mapping\Entity', 'Doctrine\ODM\MongoDB\Mapping\Annotations\Document']` · standardy: perCs `[@final, @Entity, '@ORM\Entity', '@ORM\Mapping\Entity', '@Mapping\Entity', @Document, '@ODM\Document', 'Doctrine\ORM\Mapping\Entity', 'Doctrine\ODM\MongoDB\Mapping\Annotations\Document']`, psr12 `[@final, @Entity, '@ORM\Entity', '@ORM\Mapping\Entity', '@Mapping\Entity', @Document, '@ODM\Document', 'Doctrine\ORM\Mapping\Entity', 'Doctrine\ODM\MongoDB\Mapping\Annotations\Document']`, nette `[@final, @Entity, '@ORM\Entity', '@ORM\Mapping\Entity', '@Mapping\Entity', @Document, '@ODM\Document', 'Doctrine\ORM\Mapping\Entity', 'Doctrine\ODM\MongoDB\Mapping\Annotations\Document']`, symfony `[@final, @Entity, '@ORM\Entity', '@ORM\Mapping\Entity', '@Mapping\Entity', @Document, '@ODM\Document', 'Doctrine\ORM\Mapping\Entity', 'Doctrine\ODM\MongoDB\Mapping\Annotations\Document']`, laravel `[@final, @Entity, '@ORM\Entity', '@ORM\Mapping\Entity', '@Mapping\Entity', @Document, '@ODM\Document', 'Doctrine\ORM\Mapping\Entity', 'Doctrine\ODM\MongoDB\Mapping\Annotations\Document']` .[decision-facts]


classes.members.order
=====================

The order of the members of a class by kind, a member taking the most particular kind listed (the constructor, the destructor or a magic method, then its visibility with `static`, its visibility, its kind) and the kinds not listed following in the order written.

- seznam v pořadí, ve kterém mají stát, z těchto slov:
	- `traitUse`: a trait use
	- `enumCase`: a case of an enum
	- `constant`: a constant of any visibility
	- `publicConstant`: a public constant
	- `protectedConstant`: a protected constant
	- `privateConstant`: a private constant
	- `property`: a property of any visibility
	- `publicProperty`: a public property
	- `protectedProperty`: a protected property
	- `privateProperty`: a private property
	- `publicStaticProperty`: a public static property
	- `protectedStaticProperty`: a protected static property
	- `privateStaticProperty`: a private static property
	- `method`: a method of any visibility
	- `publicMethod`: a public method
	- `protectedMethod`: a protected method
	- `privateMethod`: a private method
	- `publicStaticMethod`: a public static method
	- `protectedStaticMethod`: a protected static method
	- `privateStaticMethod`: a private static method
	- `constructor`: the constructor
	- `destructor`: the destructor
	- `magicMethod`: a method whose name begins with `__`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `[traitUse]`, psr12 `[traitUse]`, nette `[traitUse, enumCase, publicConstant, protectedConstant, privateConstant, publicProperty, protectedProperty, privateProperty]`, symfony `[traitUse]`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `ordered_class_elements`, `PSR12.Traits.UseDeclaration` .[decision-facts]

Členové, jejichž druh seznam nejmenuje, zůstanou za vyjmenovanými v pořadí, jak stojí. Druh se bere nejkonkrétnější: s `[constant, privateConstant]` se privátní konstanta řadí jako `privateConstant`. Druh, na který vedle jeho zjemnění nic nezbývá, seznam nepřijme: `[constant, publicConstant, protectedConstant, privateConstant]` je chyba konfigurace. Nette Coding Standard řadí konstanty a vlastnosti podle viditelnosti a metody nechává tak, jak je autor napsal:

```neon
classes:
	members:
		order: [traitUse, enumCase, publicConstant, protectedConstant, privateConstant, publicProperty, protectedProperty, privateProperty]
```


classes.modifiers.order
=======================

The order of the modifiers of a property, a promoted one included, a method, a constant and a class, `final readonly class`.

- `canonical`: `abstract` or `final`, visibility, set visibility, `static`, `readonly`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `canonical`, psr12 `canonical`, nette `canonical`, symfony `canonical`, laravel `canonical` · pokrývá `modifier_keywords`, `visibility_required`, `PSR2.Classes.PropertyDeclaration`, `PSR2.Methods.MethodDeclaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.PropertyDeclaration` .[decision-facts]


classes.members.grouping.constant
=================================

A declaration of several constants of a class, `const A = 1, B = 2;`.

- `separated`: one member per declaration, each sharing the modifiers and the type of the original
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `separated`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `separated`, laravel `separated` · pokrývá `single_class_element_per_statement`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.DisallowMultiConstantDefinition` .[decision-facts]


classes.members.grouping.property
=================================

A declaration of several properties, `public $a, $b;`.

- `separated`: one member per declaration, each sharing the modifiers and the type of the original
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `separated`, psr12 `separated`, nette `separated`, symfony `separated`, laravel `separated` · pokrývá `single_class_element_per_statement`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.DisallowMultiPropertyDefinition` .[decision-facts]


classes.members.grouping.traitUse
=================================

A `use` of several traits, `use A, B;`.

- `separated`: one member per declaration, each sharing the modifiers and the type of the original
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `separated`, psr12 `separated`, nette `separated`, symfony `separated`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `single_trait_insert_per_statement`, `PSR12.Traits.UseDeclaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.TraitUseDeclaration` .[decision-facts]


classes.overridingMethod.signature
==================================

The return type, the types of the parameters, the parameters added with a default, the visibility and `static` of a method overriding one of a parent class or an interface, as the ancestor declares them.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · jen s typy · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


classes.overridingMethod.parameterName
======================================

The names of the parameters of a method overriding one of a parent class or an interface, as the ancestor names them.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · jen s typy · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


classes.protectedInEnum
=======================

A `protected` member of an enum, which is `private`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `protected_to_private` .[decision-facts]


classes.protectedInFinalClass
=============================

A `protected` member of a final class with no parent and no trait, which is `private`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `forbidden`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `protected_to_private` .[decision-facts]


classes.visibility.publicWithSet
================================

The `public` of a property with a set visibility, `public protected(set) int $x`, which reads the same without it.

- `required`: always there
- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · PHP 8.4 · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `required`, nette `required`, symfony `required`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


classes.staticMethod
====================

The `static` keyword of a method that does not use `$this`, of the visibilities `classes.staticMethodVisibilities` names, its calls `$this->method()` written `self::method()`; a magic method and one whose body could reach the object otherwise are left.

- `required`: always there, `static function`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `static_private_method` .[decision-facts]


classes.staticMethodVisibilities
================================

The visibilities of the methods made static.

- seznam z těchto slov:
	- `private`: a private method
	- `protected`: a protected method, where no child and no ancestor can declare it
	- `public`: a public method, where no child and no ancestor can declare it

Výchozí `[private]` · standardy: perCs `[private]`, psr12 `[private]`, nette `[private]`, symfony `[private]`, laravel `[private]` .[decision-facts]


classes.modifiers.implied
=========================

A modifier PHP implies anyway, `final` in a final class, `readonly` in a readonly class, `protected(set)` of a public readonly property.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `no_redundant_readonly_property`, `no_unneeded_final_method`, `Generic.CodeAnalysis.UnnecessaryFinalModifier` .[decision-facts]


classes.untypedPropertyNullDefault
==================================

`public $a = null;` says what `public $a;` says.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `no_null_property_initialization` .[decision-facts]


classes.overridingMethod.parentCallOnly
=======================================

A method that only forwards to the parent with the same arguments adds nothing.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · jen s typy · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


classes.overridingMethod.ReturnTypeWillChange
=============================================

The attribute where the method declares the return type of what it implements.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


classes.visibility.constant
===========================

The visibility of a constant of a class, an interface, a trait or an enum.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `required`, nette `required`, symfony `required`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `modifier_keywords`, `visibility_required`, `PSR12.Properties.ConstantVisibility`, `PSR2.Classes.PropertyDeclaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.ClassConstantVisibility`, `Squiz.Scope.MethodScope` .[decision-facts]


classes.visibility.property
===========================

The visibility of a property, a promoted one included, `var` becoming `public` and a set visibility counting as one.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `required`, nette `required`, symfony `required`, laravel `required` · pokrývá `modifier_keywords`, `visibility_required`, `PSR12.Properties.ConstantVisibility`, `PSR2.Classes.PropertyDeclaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.ClassConstantVisibility`, `Squiz.Scope.MethodScope` .[decision-facts]


classes.visibility.method
=========================

The visibility of a method outside an interface, whose methods take `interfaceMethod`.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `required`, nette `required`, symfony `required`, laravel `required` · pokrývá `modifier_keywords`, `visibility_required`, `PSR12.Properties.ConstantVisibility`, `PSR2.Classes.PropertyDeclaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.ClassConstantVisibility`, `Squiz.Scope.MethodScope` .[decision-facts]


classes.visibility.interfaceMethod
==================================

The `public` of a method of an interface, which is public whatever it says.

- `required`: always there
- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `required`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `required`, laravel `required` · pokrývá `modifier_keywords`, `visibility_required`, `Squiz.Scope.MethodScope` .[decision-facts]


classes.emptyParentheses.instantiation
======================================

The empty parentheses of `new` with a class, `new static` and `new $class` alike, which `new Foo()->bar()` keeps whatever this says, PHP 8.4 needing them there.

- `required`: always there, `new Foo()`
- `forbidden`: never there, `new Foo`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `required`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `required`, laravel `forbidden` · pokrývá `new_with_braces`, `new_with_parentheses`, `PSR12.Classes.ClassInstantiation`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.NewWithParentheses`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.NewWithoutParentheses` .[decision-facts]


classes.emptyParentheses.anonymousClass
=======================================

The empty parentheses of an anonymous class.

- `required`: always there, `new class()`
- `forbidden`: never there, `new class`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden`, laravel `forbidden` · pokrývá `new_with_braces`, `new_with_parentheses` .[decision-facts]


classes.emptyParentheses.attribute
==================================

The empty parentheses of an attribute.

- `required`: always there, `#[Foo()]`
- `forbidden`: never there, `#[Foo]`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `attribute_empty_parentheses` .[decision-facts]


classes.instantiationWrapping
=============================

The parentheses around an instantiation a member is accessed on, `new Foo()->bar()` or `(new Foo())->bar()`; one without the parentheses of its arguments stays wrapped.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · PHP 8.4 · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `new_expression_parentheses` .[decision-facts]
